				"talk_options": ["Say hello","What to do here","Town history","Your life"],
				"talk_one": [["Hiya! Welcome to Snowdin!","I can't remember the last#time I saw a fresh face around#here."],["&sf:4&Where did you come from?","The capital?&sp1:(susie|1|I came from#Tennesee.|-10),sp2:(noelle|4|No you didn't$c#Susie!!!|70)&"],["&sp1:(n),sf:n&You don't look like a tourist.","Are you here by yourself?"]],
